<td>I / 1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>ELEC-E7262</td>
<td>Ubiquitous Computing D&nbsp;</td>
<td>5</td>
<td>2024-2025:III-IV / 1<br>2025-2026: I-II / 1</td>
</tr>
